---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Investoren-Zugang — Off-Market Sanierungsobjekte Leipzig | wirkaufendeineimmobilie.de"
  description="Exklusiver Zugang zu kuratierten Fix & Flip Objekten in Leipzig. Off-Market, vorgeprüft, mit Renditepotenzial."
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="section inv-hero">
    <div class="container inv-hero__inner">
      <div class="label">Exklusiver Investoren-Zugang</div>
      <h1>Dein nächstes Flip-Objekt.<br /><span class="text-accent">Bevor es jemand anderes sieht.</span></h1>
      <p class="inv-hero__sub">
        Off-Market Sanierungsobjekte in Leipzig. Kuratiert, vorgeprüft, mit Renditepotenzial.
        Exklusiver Zugang für verifizierte Investoren.
      </p>
      <div class="inv-hero__buttons">
        <a href="#investor-form" class="btn btn-primary">Investoren-Zugang anfragen &rarr;</a>
        <a href="#benefits" class="btn btn-outline">Mehr erfahren &darr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BENEFITS 3-CARDS -->
  <section class="inv-benefits" id="benefits">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="inv-benefits__grid">
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-card__icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Off-Market Zugang</h3>
          <p>Objekte bevor sie auf ImmoScout landen. Direkter Zugang zu Verkäufern über unser Netzwerk.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-card__icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Kuratierte Objekte</h3>
          <p>Vorgeprüft, mit Renditepotenzial, kalkulierbar. Wir filtern — du entscheidest.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-card__icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Geschlossenes Verfahren</h3>
          <p>Faire Preisfindung im Angebotsverfahren, kein Bieterwettlauf. Ein Gebot pro Käufer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROI TEASER -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container roi-teaser">
      <h2>Was bringt dein nächster Flip?</h2>
      <p class="text-mid">Rechne es durch — mit echten Leipziger Marktdaten.</p>
      <a href="/roi-rechner" class="btn btn-dark" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="10" x2="10" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="10" x2="14" y2="10"/><line x1="16" y1="10" x2="16" y2="10"/><line x1="8" y1="14" x2="10" y2="14"/><line x1="12" y1="14" x2="14" y2="14"/><line x1="16" y1="14" x2="16" y2="14"/><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="10" y2="18"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="16" y2="18"/></svg>
        ROI-Rechner öffnen &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- REGISTRATION FORM — 2-Column Split -->
  <section class="inv-form-section bg-alt" id="investor-form">
    <div class="container inv-form-split">
      <div class="inv-form-split__text">
        <h2>Bereit für den ersten Deal?</h2>
        <p class="text-mid">Wir prüfen jeden Antrag persönlich. Antwort innerhalb von 48 Stunden.</p>
        <ul class="inv-form-split__checks">
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-success)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Täglich neue Off-Market Deals
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-success)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Detaillierte Sanierungs-Kalkulationen
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-success)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Support bei der Finanzierung
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="inv-form-card">
        <form class="inv-form" id="investor-reg-form">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="inv-name">Name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="inv-name" name="name" required placeholder="Vorname Nachname" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="inv-email">E-Mail *</label>
            <input type="email" id="inv-email" name="email" required placeholder="max@beispiel.de" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="inv-tel">Telefon</label>
            <input type="tel" id="inv-tel" name="telefon" placeholder="0341 123 456" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="inv-erfahrung">Erfahrungslevel *</label>
              <select id="inv-erfahrung" name="erfahrung" required>
                <option value="">Bitte wählen...</option>
                <option value="0">Noch kein Deal abgeschlossen</option>
                <option value="1-2">1-2 Deals</option>
                <option value="3+">3+ Deals</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="inv-gewerk">Gewerk (optional)</label>
              <select id="inv-gewerk" name="gewerk">
                <option value="">Keins / nicht relevant</option>
                <option value="maler">Maler</option>
                <option value="elektriker">Elektriker</option>
                <option value="shk">SHK (Sanitär/Heizung)</option>
                <option value="trockenbau">Trockenbau</option>
                <option value="fliesenleger">Fliesenleger</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary inv-form__submit">Zugang anfragen &rarr;</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* HERO */
  .inv-hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: var(--space-20);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .inv-hero__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .inv-hero__sub {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-mid);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .inv-hero__buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Outline Button (Ghost for light bg) */
  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
    font-family: var(--font-family);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-default);
    min-height: 44px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04);
  }

  /* BENEFITS — full width bg */
  .inv-benefits {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    padding-block: var(--section-gap);
  }

  .inv-benefits__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .benefit-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: box-shadow var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-default),
                transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-default);
  }

  .benefit-card:hover {
    box-shadow:
      0 4px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04),
      0 8px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1),
      0 16px 48px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .benefit-card__icon {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--color-accent-light);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: background var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-default),
                color var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-default);
  }

  .benefit-card:hover .benefit-card__icon {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-text-on-accent);
  }

  .benefit-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-mid);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .inv-benefits__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* ROI TEASER */
  .roi-teaser {
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Dark Button */
  .btn-dark {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-text-on-dark);
    box-shadow:
      0 2px 4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15),
      0 4px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
    font-family: var(--font-family);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    line-height: 1;
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-default);
    min-height: 44px;
  }

  .btn-dark:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-light);
    color: var(--color-text-on-dark);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* FORM SECTION — 2 Column Split */
  .inv-form-section {
    padding-block: var(--section-gap);
  }

  .inv-form-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .inv-form-split__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .inv-form-split__text h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  }

  .inv-form-split__checks {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .inv-form-split__checks li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .inv-form-split__checks li svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Form Card */
  .inv-form-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);
    box-shadow:
      0 4px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04),
      0 8px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1),
      0 16px 48px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
  }

  .inv-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .form-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
  }

  .form-group label {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text-mid);
  }

  .form-group input,
  .form-group select {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .inv-form__submit {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .inv-form-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }

    .form-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('investor-reg-form') as HTMLFormElement;
  form?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const formData = new FormData(form);
    const btn = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const originalText = btn.textContent;
    btn.textContent = 'Wird gesendet...';
    btn.disabled = true;

    try {
      const res = await fetch('/api/investor', { method: 'POST', body: formData });
      if (res.ok) {
        window.location.href = '/danke?typ=investor';
      } else {
        btn.textContent = 'Fehler — bitte erneut versuchen';
        btn.disabled = false;
        setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = originalText; }, 3000);
      }
    } catch {
      btn.textContent = 'Fehler — bitte erneut versuchen';
      btn.disabled = false;
      setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = originalText; }, 3000);
    }
  });
</script>
